# 🎪 EventOS — Master Core Lifecycle & Testing Guide (Steps 1 to 5)

> **Kya yahi EventOS ke Core Features hain?**
> **HAAN, 100%!** EventOS ka poora business model isi 5-step lifecycle par tiki hai. Ek event planner ya agency shuru se aakhri tak jo kaam karti hai — **Inquiry aane se lekar client ko aakhri photo gallery deliver karne tak** — wo sab in 5 steps me complete hota hai.

---

